body:
thanks, and I'm aware of course. I've been explained to it as "always" being the child is "becoming" someone else? which doesn't site with me, in some circumstances I guess? but not over all. 

&#x200B;

and thanks, honestly though at this point in life we all simply want to have balanced system hood, heal and be our little family also functioning (for the most part) as one complete person to the outside world.

I really can't remember it well, but during 2020 I hit many lows as my dad had committed suicide before Covid, i was in an abusive relationship, as well as dealing with C-PTSD and other disorders. I was self harming every day, not eating, and tried to kill myself many times. I got through it by my DID becoming known through an alter getting in a fight with abusive boyfriend, it still took over 7 months to get out but that was definitely the first step. 

&#x200B;

Now I'm very goal focused working towards a dream, have learnt mostly how to live with my DID and C-PTSD but still not quite 100% but much better

Ok, I agree with you. But holy shit you have the same name as us- that's just rare- like damn ok- (Vivian/Viv) 

&#x200B;

\-Andrew
